# Code owners for this repository.
#
# This file is a template, not a filled-in ownership map: the actual
# maintainer GitHub usernames/teams aren't known from within the
# repository itself, so nothing below is uncommented yet. A repo admin
# should fill in real @usernames or @org/team-name per area (GitHub
# silently ignores CODEOWNERS lines referencing a user/team that isn't a
# collaborator, so an unfilled line is inert, not broken - but it also
# means review requests won't actually be auto-assigned until this is
# done).
#
# Later matches take precedence over earlier ones, same as .gitignore.

# Example (uncomment and replace with real owners):
# *                                          @ertis-research/maintainers
# /backend/                                  @some-backend-owner
# /frontend/                                 @some-frontend-owner
# /model_training/ /model_inference/         @some-ml-owner
# /federated-module/                         @some-federated-owner
# /kustomize/ /federated-module/kustomize/   @some-devops-owner
# /.github/                                  @some-devops-owner
